            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nPolling mode: no Lime Webhooks needed. The trigger checks the API every minute. The rename must not fire (the condition watches phone); the 2 minute Wait puts the rename and the phone change into different checks. If the trigger fires for the rename, its phone is empty and the Assert fails."
